/* Cocaine — zh-Hans: SSH hosts (AI agents on remote machines, through the user's own ssh) */

"A Host from ~/.ssh/config, or user@host (with :port if needed). Nothing is connected until you install the relay." = "~/.ssh/config 中的 Host，或 user@host（需要时加 :端口）。安装中继之前不会连接任何东西。";
"Add an SSH host" = "添加 SSH 主机";
"Add host…" = "添加主机…";
"Another host…" = "其他主机…";
"Brought %@ forward: the tab with that ssh connection wasn't found (opened from another app, a jump host, or a background connection)." = "已将 %@ 置于前台：未找到该 ssh 连接所在的标签页（由其他应用、跳板主机或后台连接打开）。";
"Can't add that host" = "无法添加该主机";
"Can't reach it: unknown host name." = "无法连接：未知的主机名。";
"Can't reach it." = "无法连接。";
"Change these files" = "更改这些文件";
"Check hooks…" = "检查钩子…";
"Cocaine copies one small script (perl) and a key into ~/.cocaine there, through your own ssh. Nothing else changes and no port is opened. The AI tools' settings there change only after you review them." = "Cocaine 通过你自己的 ssh，把一个小脚本（perl）和一个密钥复制到对方的 ~/.cocaine。其他一切不变，也不会打开任何端口。对方的 AI 工具设置只会在你检查之后才更改。";
"Cocaine runs /usr/bin/ssh with your ~/.ssh/config and keys, host keys always checked, nothing forwarded" = "Cocaine 使用你的 ~/.ssh/config 和密钥运行 /usr/bin/ssh，始终检查主机密钥，不转发任何东西";
"Cocaine runs on that machine itself: its own hooks are left alone." = "那台机器上运行着 Cocaine 本身：不会改动它自己的钩子。";
"Codex asks to trust new hooks once: run /hooks in Codex there." = "Codex 会要求信任一次新钩子：请在对方的 Codex 中运行 /hooks。";
"Connect to %@" = "连接到 %@";
"Connect to the host first, or remove it from Cocaine only." = "请先连接到该主机，或仅从 Cocaine 中移除。";
"Connect to the host first." = "请先连接到该主机。";
"Connected · hooks: %@" = "已连接 · 钩子：%@";
"Connected · no hooks there yet" = "已连接 · 尚无钩子";
"Couldn't be read: left alone." = "无法读取：保持原样。";
"Couldn't keep the host's key in the Keychain." = "无法将主机密钥保存到钥匙串。";
"Follow AI agents on SSH hosts" = "跟踪 SSH 主机上的 AI 代理";
"From your ~/.ssh/config and known_hosts (only read):" = "来自你的 ~/.ssh/config 和 known_hosts（只读）：";
"Hooks added there." = "已在对方添加钩子。";
"Hooks removed there." = "已在对方移除钩子。";
"host unreachable" = "主机不可达";
"Install relay…" = "安装中继…";
"Install the relay on %@?" = "要在 %@ 上安装中继吗？";
"Installing the relay…" = "正在安装中继…";
"It isn't connected: its hooks and ~/.cocaine stay there until you remove them (rm -rf ~/.cocaine, and Cocaine's lines in the AI tools' settings)." = "未连接：它的钩子和 ~/.cocaine 会留在对方，直到你自己移除（rm -rf ~/.cocaine，以及 AI 工具设置中 Cocaine 的行）。";
"Letters, digits and . _ @ : - only" = "仅限字母、数字和 . _ @ : -";
"Log" = "日志";
"Log in in Terminal" = "在终端中登录";
"new file" = "新文件";
"Not a host name ssh can be given." = "不是可以交给 ssh 的主机名。";
"Not a JSON file Cocaine can edit safely: left alone." = "不是 Cocaine 能安全编辑的 JSON 文件：保持原样。";
"Not now" = "以后再说";
"Nothing Cocaine can change there." = "Cocaine 在那里无可更改。";
"Nothing to change: the hooks there are up to date." = "无需更改：对方的钩子已是最新。";
"Nothing was changed there (%@)." = "对方未做任何更改（%@）。";
"Off (all SSH hosts)" = "已关闭（所有 SSH 主机）";
"Only Cocaine's own lines go; everything else in those files stays. A backup is kept in ~/.cocaine/backup there." = "只移除 Cocaine 自己的行，这些文件中的其他内容保持不变。对方的 ~/.cocaine/backup 中会保留备份。";
"Reading the AI tools' settings there…" = "正在读取 AI 工具的设置…";
"Relay installed." = "中继已安装。";
"Relay not installed yet" = "尚未安装中继";
"Remove %@?" = "要移除 %@ 吗？";
