"Remove from Cocaine only" = "仅从 Cocaine 中移除";
"Remove hooks" = "移除钩子";
"Remove, and take Cocaine off the host" = "移除，并从主机上撤下 Cocaine";
"Review hooks…" = "检查钩子…";
"Shows what would change in the AI tools' settings there, before anything is written" = "在写入任何内容之前，显示对方 AI 工具设置中将会更改的内容";
"SSH hosts" = "SSH 主机";
"SSH hosts: %d of %d connected" = "SSH 主机：已连接 %d / %d";
"Taking Cocaine off the host removes its hooks there and ~/.cocaine." = "从主机上撤下 Cocaine 会移除对方的钩子和 ~/.cocaine。";
"That host has no perl with JSON::PP and Digest::SHA, which the relay needs." = "该主机没有中继所需的带 JSON::PP 和 Digest::SHA 的 perl。";
"That host is already in the list." = "该主机已在列表中。";
"The connection was lost." = "连接已断开。";
"The host didn't answer." = "主机没有响应。";
"The host isn't connected: nothing was changed." = "主机未连接：未做任何更改。";
"The host's key has CHANGED since it was trusted: Cocaine won't connect. If you expected it, update ~/.ssh/known_hosts in Terminal." = "主机密钥自受信任以来已更改：Cocaine 不会连接。如果这在你的预料之中，请在终端中更新 ~/.ssh/known_hosts。";
"The list is full." = "列表已满。";
"The login was refused (key, ssh agent or MFA). Log in once in Terminal, or check your key." = "登录被拒绝（密钥、ssh 代理或 MFA）。请在终端中登录一次，或检查你的密钥。";
"The relay couldn't be removed there." = "无法移除对方的中继。";
"The relay isn't on that host." = "该主机上没有中继。";
"The relay there has another key: install it again." = "对方的中继使用的是另一个密钥：请重新安装。";
"The terminal with that ssh connection wasn't found on this Mac." = "在这台 Mac 上未找到该 ssh 连接所在的终端。";
"These files on %@ would change:" = "%@ 上的以下文件将会更改：";
"This host's key isn't in ~/.ssh/known_hosts yet: connect once in Terminal to check and accept it." = "该主机的密钥尚未在 ~/.ssh/known_hosts 中：请在终端中连接一次，以检查并接受它。";
"Through your own ssh: alerts, plans, questions and approvals in the notch. No port is opened; each host only after your OK." = "通过你自己的 ssh：在刘海中处理提醒、计划、问题和批准。不打开任何端口；每台主机都需经你同意。";
"Unreachable: trying again at %@" = "无法连接：将于 %@ 重试";
"Updating the relay…" = "正在更新中继…";
"user@host or a config Host" = "user@host 或 config 中的 Host";
"What was done on each host, when (never any content)" = "在每台主机上何时做了什么（从不记录内容）";
"Working…" = "处理中…";
